{"id":"664759","name":"蒜蓉黑虎虾","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664759/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑虎虾","amount":"450g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"3头"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑虎虾自然解冻。","img":"images/664759/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去虾头，减掉须子和脚，开背去虾线。","img":"images/664759/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黑胡椒海盐，姜片，腌制。","img":"images/664759/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅放多一点油。","img":"images/664759/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煸炒虾头。","img":"images/664759/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入姜片，煸出虾油。","img":"images/664759/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出虾头，嗯，别扔，加点开水，做个汤底，味道鲜美。","img":"images/664759/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"虾油放入蒜末。","img":"images/664759/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入虾小火煎。","img":"images/664759/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎到5成熟，放入一块黄油，给虾翻面。","img":"images/664759/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加一点开水，大火收汁。","img":"images/664759/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捞出控油。","img":"images/664759/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"撒一点香菜。","img":"images/664759/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/664759/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}